.Sh DIAGNOSTICS
.Bl -diag
.It "ERROR: kldload-seal failed on the copy of SOURCE \(em refusing to ship an unsealed image. ..."
The seal's reason is above.
Nothing is exported; the copy is removed.
.It "[kexport][warn] could not remove the clone CLONE"
.It "[kexport][warn] could not remove the snapshot SNAPSHOT"
The export finished; remove them with
.Ql zfs destroy -r .
.It "ERROR: a FORMAT file cannot be mounted for FORMAT; ..."
The container formats and
.Li firecracker
read a raw image or a disk; convert the file first, or give the volume.
.It "ERROR: SOURCE or a partition of it is mounted on this host \(em refusing to mount it again"
.El
